{"product_id":"infinity-smartwatch","title":"Infinity Smartwatch","description":" \u003ch2\u003eInfinity Smartwatch Product Description\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        A seamless blend of technology and style crafted to elevate your everyday life. Infinity Smartwatch is designed for the modern individual, this sleek smartwatch offers unparalleled functionality and aesthetics, making it the perfect companion for both work and play.   \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Whether you're tracking your fitness goals, staying connected on the go, or simply looking to make a fashion statement, the Infinity Smartwatch has you covered.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eFeatures of Infinity Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Experience the future of wearable tech with the Infinity Smartwatch's impressive array of features.  \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Stay on top of your health with its advanced fitness tracking capabilities, including heart rate monitoring, sleep analysis, and activity tracking.  \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Never miss a beat with smart notifications for calls, messages, and social media updates directly on your wrist.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        The Infinity Smartwatch also boasts a long-lasting battery life, ensuring you're always powered up for your next adventure. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Its customizable watch faces and interchangeable straps allow you to personalize your look to match any occasion.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eSpecifications of Infinity Smartwatch\u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Display: 1.4-inch IPS full touch screen\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Resolution: 240 x 240 Pixels\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Sensors: Heart rate monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Compatibility: iOS and Android\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Strap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Dimensions: 44 x 38 x 10.7mm\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Connectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Battery Life: Up to 7 days\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Water Resistance: IP68 rating\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Weight: 38g\n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Infinity SmartWatch? \u003c\/h2\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Choosing the Infinity Smartwatch means embracing a lifestyle of convenience and sophistication. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        With its robust set of features, exceptional build quality, and stylish design, this smartwatch stands out as a top contender in the market. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        It not only helps you stay organized and active but also adds a touch of elegance to your everyday ensemble. \n    \u003c\/p\u003e\n    \u003cp\u003e\n        Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a seamless experience from purchase to usage.\n    \u003c\/p\u003e \n\u003ch2\u003eDo you have any ongoing sales?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eYes! Take advantage of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/pages\/11-11-sale\"\u003e11.11 Sale\u003c\/a\u003e for exclusive discounts on smartwatches and earbuds.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rose Gold","offer_id":48340258521366,"sku":"20456","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48340258488598,"sku":"20455","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48340258455830,"sku":"20454","price":8999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/Infinity_slvr.webp?v=1729678902","url":"https:\/\/zerolifestyle.co\/products\/infinity-smartwatch","provider":"ZeroLifestyle.co","version":"1.0","type":"link"}